WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.426
Hi! Today we'll learn how to find a percentage of a number.

2
00:00:06.576 --> 00:00:11.562
There are 80 flowers in the garden. 30 percent of them are red.

3
00:00:11.712 --> 00:00:15.474
How many red flowers are there?

4
00:00:15.624 --> 00:00:26.106
Draw a bar model. The whole bar is 80 flowers, which is 100 percent. Split it into 10 equal parts. Each part is 10 percent.

5
00:00:26.256 --> 00:00:30.930
10 percent is 80 divided by 10, which is 8 flowers.

6
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:36.714
30 percent is 3 parts. 3 times 8 is 24 flowers.

7
00:00:36.864 --> 00:00:42.570
We can also work it out directly: 30 hundredths times 80 is 24.

8
00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:51.402
What about the other flowers? They are 70 percent: 80 minus 24 is 56 flowers.

9
00:00:51.552 --> 00:00:55.770
One more: what is 15 percent of 60 dollars?

10
00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:02.034
10 percent is 6 dollars. 5 percent is half of that, which is 3 dollars.

11
00:01:02.184 --> 00:01:08.034
So 15 percent is 6 plus 3, which is 9 dollars.

12
00:01:08.184 --> 00:01:16.626
Watch out! Some pupils treat 30 percent as 30 flowers, and do 80 minus 30 to get 50. That is wrong!

13
00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:24.018
30 percent means 30 hundredths. We multiply it by 80, and the answer is 24 flowers.

14
00:01:24.168 --> 00:01:31.578
A percentage is not an amount. Change it to hundredths first, then multiply by the whole.

15
00:01:31.728 --> 00:01:40.938
Your turn! What is 25 percent of 120? Pause and think.

16
00:01:41.088 --> 00:01:49.578
25 percent is one quarter, and one quarter of 120 is 30. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:49.728 --> 00:01:58.746
Another one! What is 40 percent of 35 dollars? Pause and think.

18
00:01:58.896 --> 00:02:08.850
10 percent is 3 dollars 50 cents, so 40 percent is 4 times that, which is 14 dollars. Did you get it right?

19
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:17.586
Another one! What is 20 percent of 45? Pause and think.

20
00:02:17.736 --> 00:02:27.282
First find 10 percent, which is 4.5. 20 percent is double that, so it is 9. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:27.432 --> 00:02:35.994
Last one! What is 75 percent of 40? Pause and think.

22
00:02:36.144 --> 00:02:46.218
75 percent is 3 quarters. 40 divided by 4 is 10, and 10 times 3 is 30. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:46.368 --> 00:02:56.106
Remember: to find a percentage of a number, multiply the number by that many hundredths. Or find 10 percent first, then build the percentage you need.

24
00:02:56.256 --> 00:03:00.450
Now go and practise in your garden!

